# ============================================================
# Test: FireDustBaseline
# Description: Fire and dust running concurrently but without
#              fire-dust coupling (fire_dust_coupling = false).
#              Passive fire coupling mode. Flat terrain.
#              Serves as the baseline to compare against
#              FireDustInteraction1 and FireDustTerrainCoupled.
#
# Expected Results (verified from simulation output at step 20,
#                   t = 10 s, dt = 0.5 s, 4096 cells):
#
#   Dynamics:
#   - Simulation completes 20 steps without errors.
#   - Fixed dt = 0.5 s (CFL-limited compressible dt ~1.03 s,
#     anelastic dt ~25.0 s; fixed dt is binding).
#   - u*_max ~ 1.121 m/s  |  u_10m_max ~ 14.99 m/s
#   - PBLH_max ~ 534.7 m  |  T_sfc = 300 K
#
#   Fire (step 19-20):
#   - Fire ignites at (1500, 1500) with radius 200 m and spreads
#     outward using the Rothermel (fuel_model_id=1) rate of spread.
#     NOTE: ignition_r must be >= fire grid cell size (187.5 m at
#     grid_ratio=2, domain 3000 m / 16 cells) to mark burned cells.
#   - Fire operates in PASSIVE coupling mode: fire spread uses
#     PRE-dycore wind; heat/moisture flux NOT injected into atmosphere
#     (coupling_type=passive, injects_flux=false — confirmed by log:
#     "Skipping flux buffer update: coupling_type is passive").
#   - Number of active fire cells: 4
#   - Max reference wind: ~14.58 m/s (step 19), ~14.56 m/s (step 20)
#   - Wind Adjustment Factor (andrews formula) applied:
#     max effective wind ~5.27-5.28 m/s
#   - Max ROS = 0.2160244347 m/s (both steps, Rothermel model)
#   - tau_sav = 2.752 s  (dx_fire=187.5 m / max_ROS)
#   - phi_min = -1  |  phi_max = 0  (fire front level set)
#   - Q_max ~ 3520-3522 W/m^2  |  I_B_max ~ 7.26-7.64 kW/m
#   - T_flame_max ~ 533-537 K  (Byram radiant method)
#   - L_max ~ 0.193-0.198 m (flame length)
#   - 0 new perimeter points stamped (fire contained within ignition)
#   - 1 fire subcycle per atmospheric step
#
#   Dust Emission (step 20):
#   - Only bin 0 (d = 7 um) is active (n_active_bins = 1).
#   - F_dust_max (atm coupling flux) = 1.447e-07 kg/m^2/s
#   - emission_flux bin0 max = 4.821e-08 kg/m^2/s
#   - emission_flux bin0 sum = 3.085e-06 kg/m^2/s (domain total rate)
#   - emission_sum = 3.085e-06 kg/s
#   - RhoDust_tend max = 9.042e-09 kg/m^3/s
#   - Dust is driven by ambient wind with uniform crust (crust_index=1.0);
#     no crust reduction from burned areas (fire_dust_coupling=false).
#   - Emission flux matches DustTerrainFlat baseline identically,
#     confirming fire has no effect on dust in passive/uncoupled mode.
#
#   Dust Settling & Deposition (step 20):
#   - Settling velocity bin0 (d=7 um) v_s = 4.001e-03 m/s
#   - Deposition velocity v_d = 7.311e-03 m/s
#   - dep_flux_max = 6.609e-11 kg/m^2/s
#   - dep_total (accumulated) = 7.377e-08 kg/m^2
#
#   Dust Concentrations (step 20):
#   - conc_sfc_max = 8.467e-08 kg/m^3  (~84.7 ug/m^3)
#   - conc_sfc_sum = 5.419e-06 kg/m^3 (domain integral)
#   - PM10_max ~ 80.3 ug/m^3  |  PM2.5_max = 0 ug/m^3
#   - MSHA TWA = 1.333e-05 mg/m^3 (below occupational limit)
#   - All dust concentrations non-negative.
#
#   Mass Budget (step 20):
#   - RHO DUST = 12.379 (domain-integrated dust mass)
#   - MASS = 1.013e+10  |  RHO THETA = 3.080e+12
#   - RHO SCALAR = 0 (passive scalar inactive)
#
#   MRF Diffusion:
#   - EddyDiff::Scalar_v_max = 2.168 m^2/s
#   - gamma_dust = 0 (no countergradient term for dust scalar)
#   - moisture_path_active = 0 (use_dynamic_moisture = false)
#
#   PHREEQC / suppression:
#   - do_phreeqc = 1 (reader active, no external file)
#   - suppression coverage max = 0, retreat_flag sum = 0
#   - u*_t min = max = 0.05 m/s (threshold friction velocity)
#
#   Performance:
#   - Timestep wall time ~ 5.6e-03 s  |  Total ~ 0.127 s
# ============================================================

